1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,671
Can one little golden dog wake the night

2
00:00:02,721 --> 00:00:05,052
flowers before the full moon rises?

3
00:00:05,102 --> 00:00:07,909
Once upon a time, beside an ancient temple

4
00:00:07,959 --> 00:00:09,950
in Cambodia, our story begins.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,261
But this morning

6
00:00:11,311 --> 00:00:14,130
the flowers fell into a deep sleep.

7
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:16,098
Nothing could wake them.

8
00:00:16,148 --> 00:00:17,573
Without their glow

9
00:00:17,623 --> 00:00:19,950
the festival could not begin.

10
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,965
In the middle of the pond, a golden lotus

11
00:00:23,015 --> 00:00:25,979
opened, and out came a little golden dog.

12
00:00:26,029 --> 00:00:27,376
Today was a Dog day

13
00:00:27,426 --> 00:00:29,950
and the dog felt something special.

14
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,065
A butterfly named Pich fluttered down.

15
00:00:33,115 --> 00:00:34,868
"Little Dog," she said

16
00:00:34,918 --> 00:00:37,901
"only you can wake the night flowers.

17
00:00:37,951 --> 00:00:39,950
Today is your lucky day!"

18
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,964
Faithful guardian of the home

19
00:00:42,014 --> 00:00:43,769
the Dog symbolizes loyalty

20
00:00:43,819 --> 00:00:46,131
protection, and honest friendship.

21
00:00:46,181 --> 00:00:46,964
Pich smiled.

22
00:00:47,014 --> 00:00:48,353
That was exactly why

23
00:00:48,403 --> 00:00:49,950
the moon had chosen it.

24
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,983
To wake the night flowers

25
00:00:52,033 --> 00:00:54,259
the little hero needed three

26
00:00:54,309 --> 00:00:56,861
lucky treasures: its lucky color

27
00:00:56,911 --> 00:00:59,950
its lucky path, and its lucky numbers.

28
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,842
"Let's go!" said the dog

29
00:01:02,892 --> 00:01:06,577
and it set off on its adventure

30
00:01:06,627 --> 00:01:09,950
with Pich right by its side.

31
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,506
People born in the Year of the Dog

32
00:01:12,556 --> 00:01:15,063
are loyal, honest, and protective.

33
00:01:15,113 --> 00:01:17,093
Dogs are deeply trustworthy

34
00:01:17,143 --> 00:01:19,950
and stand up for what they believe in.

35
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,258
The first treasure was waiting

36
00:01:22,308 --> 00:01:24,950
in a garden of a thousand lanterns.

37
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,873
Only one shone brightest.

38
00:01:26,923 --> 00:01:29,950
It was red, the dog's lucky color today.

39
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,734
The dog tied a red ribbon around its neck.

40
00:01:33,784 --> 00:01:36,797
"Wear your lucky color," said Pich

41
00:01:36,847 --> 00:01:39,950
"and good luck stays close to you."

42
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:42,555
Next, they came to a crossroads

43
00:01:42,605 --> 00:01:43,900
with many paths.

44
00:01:43,950 --> 00:01:45,832
One path began to glow.

45
00:01:45,882 --> 00:01:47,765
It pointed to the south

46
00:01:47,815 --> 00:01:49,950
the dog's lucky direction.

47
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,296
But the path led into

48
00:01:51,346 --> 00:01:52,642
a dark, quiet forest.

49
00:01:52,692 --> 00:01:53,668
The dog stopped.

50
00:01:53,718 --> 00:01:55,078
Sometimes, people born

51
00:01:55,128 --> 00:01:57,450
in the Year of the Dog can be anxious

52
00:01:57,500 --> 00:01:59,950
or overly suspicious of new situations.

53
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,521
Pich came close and smiled.

54
00:02:02,571 --> 00:02:05,093
"Breathe slowly," she said.

55
00:02:05,143 --> 00:02:06,807
"Trust your heart.

56
00:02:06,857 --> 00:02:09,950
You are stronger than you think."

57
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,686
Step by step, the dog

58
00:02:11,736 --> 00:02:13,586
walked into the forest.

59
00:02:13,636 --> 00:02:17,057
Its golden glow lit up the trees, and soon

60
00:02:17,107 --> 00:02:19,950
the whole forest was full of light.

61
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,311
The little hero learned that its worries

62
00:02:23,361 --> 00:02:26,589
were small, and its good heart was big.

63
00:02:26,639 --> 00:02:29,950
Balance and courage always help us grow.

64
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,347
At last, they reached a great

65
00:02:32,397 --> 00:02:34,413
stone door in the temple.

66
00:02:34,463 --> 00:02:36,562
Carved above it were bells

67
00:02:36,612 --> 00:02:39,950
stairs, and a riddle about lucky numbers.

68
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,368
"The door opens only

69
00:02:41,418 --> 00:02:43,496
at your best time," said Pich.

70
00:02:43,546 --> 00:02:44,702
For the Dog today

71
00:02:44,752 --> 00:02:46,829
that is from 11 in the morning

72
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:48,390
to 1 in the afternoon.

73
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:49,950
They waited patiently.

74
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,529
When the time came

75
00:02:51,579 --> 00:02:54,775
the dog rang the golden bells 3 times

76
00:02:54,825 --> 00:02:56,792
its first lucky number.

77
00:02:56,842 --> 00:02:57,845
Ding!

78
00:02:57,895 --> 00:02:59,950
The door began to shine.

79
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,104
The door opened

80
00:03:01,154 --> 00:03:03,642
and a stairway of light appeared.

81
00:03:03,692 --> 00:03:06,104
The dog climbed 48 glowing steps

82
00:03:06,154 --> 00:03:07,873
its second lucky number

83
00:03:07,923 --> 00:03:09,950
up to the top of the tower.

84
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,719
At the top of the tower

85
00:03:11,769 --> 00:03:14,642
they found a single drop of golden dew

86
00:03:14,692 --> 00:03:16,873
sparkling in a crystal shell.

87
00:03:16,923 --> 00:03:19,950
It was the magic that wakes the flowers!

88
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,913
Around the dew drop, seven little lights

89
00:03:22,963 --> 00:03:25,802
twinkled, one for each day of the week.

90
00:03:25,852 --> 00:03:28,394
Monday and Thursday shone brightest

91
00:03:28,444 --> 00:03:29,950
the Dog's lucky days.

92
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,950
Time was running out.

93
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:34,807
Holding the dew drop carefully

94
00:03:34,857 --> 00:03:37,474
the little hero hurried home

95
00:03:37,524 --> 00:03:39,950
with Pich right beside it.

96
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:43,774
Back at the pond, everyone was waiting.

97
00:03:43,824 --> 00:03:45,538
The night was dark

98
00:03:45,588 --> 00:03:48,381
and the full moon was rising.

99
00:03:48,431 --> 00:03:49,950
Was it too late?

100
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,739
The dog let the golden

101
00:03:51,789 --> 00:03:53,690
dew fall on the flowers.

102
00:03:53,740 --> 00:03:56,210
For a moment, nothing happened.

103
00:03:56,260 --> 00:03:57,511
Then, one by one

104
00:03:57,561 --> 00:03:59,950
the flowers opened and glowed!

105
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:02,281
The night flowers glowed again.

106
00:04:02,331 --> 00:04:04,236
Lanterns rose into the sky

107
00:04:04,286 --> 00:04:06,717
and the full-moon festival began.

108
00:04:06,767 --> 00:04:07,920
Everyone cheered

109
00:04:07,970 --> 00:04:09,950
for the little golden hero!

110
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:12,718
The full moon shone down warmly

111
00:04:12,768 --> 00:04:14,771
as if to say thank you.

112
00:04:14,821 --> 00:04:17,629
The dog felt peaceful and proud.

113
00:04:17,679 --> 00:04:19,950
It had done its very best.

114
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:23,200
If you were born in the Year of the Dog

115
00:04:23,250 --> 00:04:25,033
today is your day too.

116
00:04:25,083 --> 00:04:27,700
Like our hero, be brave, be kind

117
00:04:27,750 --> 00:04:29,950
and follow your good heart.

118
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,780
Let's remember today's luck.

119
00:04:31,830 --> 00:04:32,891
Lucky color: red.

120
00:04:32,941 --> 00:04:35,048
Best time: from 11 in the morning

121
00:04:35,098 --> 00:04:36,486
to 1 in the afternoon.

122
00:04:36,536 --> 00:04:37,989
Lucky direction: south.

123
00:04:38,039 --> 00:04:39,950
Lucky numbers: 3, 48, and 349.

124
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:43,219
And so, under the bright full moon

125
00:04:43,269 --> 00:04:46,681
the little golden hero and Pich fell

126
00:04:46,731 --> 00:04:49,950
fast asleep, dreaming of tomorrow.

127
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,617
That's your Chinese zodiac

128
00:04:51,667 --> 00:04:52,771
fortune for today.

129
00:04:52,821 --> 00:04:54,053
See all twelve signs

130
00:04:54,103 --> 00:04:56,745
and your lucky numbers at mybirthsign.com.

131
00:04:56,795 --> 00:04:58,860
Follow us for tomorrow's fortune.

132
00:04:58,910 --> 00:04:59,950
Have a lucky day!
